      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Imipramine binding to platelet membranes from depressed patients was analyzed. The patients were divided into two groups: one with depression alone, another with depression and psychogenic pain. The depressed patients with psychogenic pain had lower imipramine binding than the depressed patients without pain."},
